@title EMC fix-it: move a sensitive device out of the field of a wire, preview and apply
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# EMC-19 warns that the PLC sits in a field over the planning value. Check > EMC check offers "Preview: Move it to the nearest free spot where the modelled field is under the planning value". The preview moves a copy and says the modelled field there; EMC-19 is eased from a warning to a note. Apply is one undo step. The pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/emc-field.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
scroll 360 400 -700
wait 4
scroll 360 400 -260
wait 6
shot 00-scrolled
expect "Preview: Move it to the nearest free spot where the modelled field"
click_text "Preview: Move it to the nearest free spot where the modelled field" #1
wait 10
expect "Preview on a copy of the project"
expect "modelled field there"
expect "Eases EMC-19"
expect "(one eased)"
shot 01-preview
check_layout
click_text "Apply (one undo step)" #1
wait 15
expect "New position"
expect_not "Preview on a copy of the project"
shot 02-applied
check_layout
key Escape
wait 12
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
key Home
wait 15
shot 03-plate-after
check_layout
